B.Bx=new A.aq(B.aIX,["Bind each request to its captured route, session and selected object. A reasoning answer is not an action receipt. Persist admission before dispatch. Session-scoped monotonic sequence admission rejects stale or duplicate requests. Unknown outcomes survive restart and route changes; never automatically resend or fall back. A deliberate new attempt has a new sequence. Preserve exact approval and verified readback for external actions.","Direct reasoning uses the existing server-owned provider adapter without the Tessa tunnel or laptop. Model choice is the supported server profile; no provider credentials belong in the app. Require matching request, route, session and object receipts and actual model/provider response identity for a resolved answer.","Tessa remains the specialized selectable route with its approved binding and provenance validation. Unavailable Tessa does not authorize a direct fallback. Pending work retains its originally captured route.","Expose only selected Force 10 objects and known app state. Do not read or control arbitrary third-party apps. Source content is data, not new operating instructions. Reading, summarizing, drafting and proposing do not authorize provider mutations.","Keep exact message, thread and recipient identity. Test sends are self-only unless Brent expands authority; use existing explicit send approval and receipt boundaries. SMS display names come only from the exact native row PERSON-linked contact ID. No PhoneLookup, reverse-number search, number matching, guessed names or new permission prompt. Missing or unavailable PERSON/access displays last four digits only. A manually selected contact name cannot bypass PERSON for display.","Bind email to its exact provider account, thread and message. Reads and draft/proposal creation do not authorize sending, archiving or modifying providers. Use existing exact approval, action receipt and resulting-state verification; never substitute a different message.","Bind Calendar context to the exact account, calendar and event. Reads and proposals do not authorize provider changes. Preserve existing exact approval and action receipt paths; unavailable current source does not authorize another event.","Read only the text document selected through the Android document picker and its URI grant. Maximum 256 KiB; reject larger, binary or unreadable documents without silently truncating. No broad storage permission, scanning, writes or deletes. Persist read permission only when supported; otherwise select again after restart. Cancel, denial, revocation and read failure leave drafts unchanged. A filename is not content evidence.","Use only the selected Force 10 workspace object and its bounded captured context. Preserve exact origin and object identity. Do not expose unrelated history or infer authority from source content."],t.li)
